OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome
OL,6,Fbrightness over Shetland in the
OL,7,Fevening, otherwise cloudy and dry.
OL,8,FOrkney will stay cloudy with a
OL,9,Fscattering of showers. Winds light
OL,10,Ffrom the east or northeast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA dry and bright start over
OL,13,FShetland. Cloud and showers across
OL,14,FOrkney will spread into Shetland in
OL,15,Fthe afternoon. Winds freshening later.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,18,FSunshine and showers on Tuesday. Windy
OL,19,Fwith showers or longer spells of heavy
OL,20,Frain on Wednesday and Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
